    "title_en": "On Modeling Anisotropic Quark Stars: The Role of Anisotropy in Radial Oscillation Spectra",
    "abstract_en": "We model the compact object Cen X-3, which is considered to be a good strange quark star candidate of known mass and radius, incorporating a negative anisotropic factor, and we compute the frequencies of the ten lowest radial oscillation modes. We introduce the anisotropy in three different manners and investigate its impact on the spectra.",
